WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.759
A lakehouse combines file storage with table-like
access Raw files

00:00:05.785 --> 00:00:12.590
may enter the lakehouse first Curated outputs are
often stored as Delta tables Spark

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:18.139
provides distributed compute over those data assets
Reports

00:00:18.258 --> 00:00:24.010
notebooks and models consume the prepared results
This layered thinking helps keep raw

00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:26.431
cleaned and analytical data separate
